This extension provides an API for communicating with Redis database,
a persistent key-value database with built-in net interface written
in ANSI-C for Posix systems.

PECL redis for php83 of azsupport/ports, with the lz4 and zstd
compression of az (liblz4, libzstd), built from ext/redis of the release
tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20230831/redis.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d.

One of the four packages of redis, which have the same files:
php83-redis, php83-redis-lz4, php83-redis-zstd are the others (only one
of them installs).
